    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819560/extras/2ee2d6d48d78e3aed7ab5f4222a9c0e6.avif?t=1755159936\" width=616 height=180 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Skogsgl\u00e4ntan, Saga\u2019s brand new Bed and Breakfast for creatures from Nordic folklore!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819560/extras/674edaf859b796633bb6262199f6fa68.avif?t=1755159936\" width=616 height=115 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819560/extras/2b38eaf08463e866924fb0c86d1166ff.poster.avif?t=1755159936\" width=616 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819560/extras/2b38eaf08463e866924fb0c86d1166ff.webm?t=1755159936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819560/extras/2b38eaf08463e866924fb0c86d1166ff.mp4?t=1755159936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Cook</strong>, <strong>build</strong>, <strong>decorate</strong> and <strong>farm</strong> to make your Bed and Breakfast flourish into the cozy retreat of your (and Saga\u2019s) dreams!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819560/extras/dd4906c34f8c59a870cd83476436c882.avif?t=1755159936\" width=616 height=115 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819560/extras/5ba266a67c3abecbd45515a8eaac69f4.poster.avif?t=1755159936\" width=616 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819560/extras/5ba266a67c3abecbd45515a8eaac69f4.webm?t=1755159936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819560/extras/5ba266a67c3abecbd45515a8eaac69f4.mp4?t=1755159936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>From Bysen to The Mountain King himself, <strong>meet a colorful cast of characters</strong> in all shapes and sizes! Learn their quirks and see how their stories unfold...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819560/extras/c6b6c99420e3b2a26283b0a71344bb6b.avif?t=1755159936\" width=616 height=115 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819560/extras/60b8503bacc4d72a62c728e4b101ff62.poster.avif?t=1755159936\" width=616 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819560/extras/60b8503bacc4d72a62c728e4b101ff62.webm?t=1755159936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819560/extras/60b8503bacc4d72a62c728e4b101ff62.mp4?t=1755159936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Venture out far beyond your new home and <strong>gather resources</strong>, <strong>meet new characters</strong>, and <strong>uncover secrets</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819560/extras/80deca1455c5e5426f749eb11c73ba5f.avif?t=1755159936\" width=616 height=115 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Saga\u2019s world, you can take things at your own pace! Dash through quests, pamper all your guests and collect every resource, or lean back and do things when you feel like it - <strong>play without pressure</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819560/extras/30daf7d14eac0c55981b1a67a277a75c.avif?t=1755159936\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
